---
import LegalPage from "../../components/LegalPage.astro";
import { COMPANY } from "../../data/company";
import { legalHref } from "../../i18n";
---

<LegalPage lang="en" page="confidentialitate">
  <p>
    This policy explains what personal data we process when you visit <strong>{COMPANY.domain}</strong> or write
    to us through the contact form, why we process it, how long we keep it and what your rights are. We process
    data in line with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR) and applicable Romanian law.
  </p>

  <h2 id="controller">1. Who processes your data</h2>
  <p>The data controller is:</p>
  <dl class="fisa">
    <dt>Company name</dt>
    <dd>{COMPANY.name}</dd>
    <dt>Registered office</dt>
    <dd>{COMPANY.address}, Romania</dd>
    <dt>Tax ID (CUI)</dt>
    <dd>{COMPANY.cui}</dd>
    <dt>Trade Register no.</dt>
    <dd>{COMPANY.regCom}</dd>
    <dt>Email</dt>
    <dd><a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a></dd>
    <dt>Phone</dt>
    <dd><a href={COMPANY.phoneHref}>+40 {COMPANY.phone.slice(1)}</a></dd>
  </dl>

  <h2 id="what-data">2. What data we process and why</h2>

  <h3>a) When you write to us through the contact form</h3>
  <p>
    The form does not send your details to a server of ours and does not store them on the website. When you press
    “Send on WhatsApp”, the text is passed to WhatsApp, which opens a chat with the message already written: your
    name, the capacity you are writing in (hospitality staff or business / organiser) and your message. The message
    only reaches us once you send it from WhatsApp, and we then also see your phone number and WhatsApp profile name.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> to answer your questions and discuss a possible collaboration.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (steps taken at your request) and Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (our
      legitimate interest in answering the requests we receive).
    </li>
    <li>
      <strong>Retention:</strong> as long as needed to answer and follow up on your request, but no longer than 12
      months after the last message, unless the law requires us to keep the data longer.
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    In the European Union, WhatsApp is provided by WhatsApp Ireland Limited, which also processes the data under
    its own privacy policy.
  </p>

  <h3>b) Visit statistics, only with your consent</h3>
  <p>
    If you accept statistics cookies, we use Google Analytics 4 to learn which pages are visited, for how long,
    from what type of device and browser, and from roughly which country or city. Google Analytics 4 does not
    store IP addresses. We do not use this data to identify you and we do not use it for advertising. If you
    decline, the Google Analytics script is not loaded at all.
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Purpose:</strong> to understand how the website is used and what needs improving.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Legal basis:</strong> your consent, under Art. 6(1)(a) GDPR. You can withdraw it at any time from the
      “Cookie settings” link in the website footer.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Retention:</strong> up to 14 months, after which the data is deleted automatically from Google Analytics.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Provider:</strong> Google Ireland Limited. Data may be transferred to Google LLC in the United States
      under the European Commission's adequacy decision for the EU-U.S. Data Privacy Framework.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h3>c) Technical data</h3>
  <p>
    When you access the website, our hosting provider's server automatically records technical data such as your
    IP address, the date and time of access, the page requested and your browser type. We use it only to run and
    secure the website, based on our legitimate interest (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR), and it is kept for a limited period.
  </p>

  <h3>d) Your cookie choice</h3>
  <p>
    Whether you accepted or declined statistics cookies is stored only in your browser, for 6 months, so we do not
    ask you on every visit. This information is not sent to us.
  </p>

  <h2 id="the-app">3. Data in the mobile app</h2>
  <p>
    The data you enter in the HoreLink app (account, profile, experience, applications, published events) is not
    covered by this policy. Its processing is described in the app's privacy policy, available on the app's page
    in Google Play and the App Store.
  </p>

  <h2 id="recipients">4. Who we share data with</h2>
  <p>We do not sell personal data and we do not use it for advertising. Data may reach:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>WhatsApp Ireland Limited, when you write to us through the form;</li>
    <li>Google Ireland Limited, only if you accept statistics cookies;</li>
    <li>the website's hosting provider, which processes technical data on our behalf;</li>
    <li>public authorities, only when the law requires it.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2 id="your-rights">5. Your rights</h2>
  <p>Under the GDPR, you have the right:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>to know what data we hold about you and to receive a copy (Art. 15);</li>
    <li>to have inaccurate data corrected (Art. 16);</li>
    <li>to have your data erased (Art. 17);</li>
    <li>to restrict processing (Art. 18);</li>
    <li>to receive your data in a structured format that you can pass to another controller (Art. 20);</li>
    <li>to object to processing based on our legitimate interest (Art. 21);</li>
    <li>to withdraw your consent at any time, without affecting processing carried out before withdrawal (Art. 7);</li>
    <li>
      to lodge a complaint with the Romanian National Supervisory Authority for Personal Data Processing
      (<a href="https://www.dataprotection.ro/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">dataprotection.ro</a>).
    </li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    To exercise any of these rights, write to <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>. We will reply
    within one month of receiving your request. If the request is complex, this period may be extended by two more
    months, in which case we will let you know.
  </p>

  <h2 id="security">6. Data security</h2>
  <p>
    The website is served over a secure connection (HTTPS) and does not store the details entered in the form. Only
    the people at HoreLink who need it to answer requests or review statistics have access to the WhatsApp
    conversations and the Google Analytics account.
  </p>

  <h2 id="children">7. Children</h2>
  <p>
    The website is not aimed at children under 16. If you find out that a child has sent us personal data, write to
    us and we will delete it.
  </p>

  <h2 id="cookies">8. Cookies</h2>
  <p>
    The full list of cookies and how to change your choice are in our{" "}
    <a href={legalHref("cookies", "en")}>Cookie policy</a>.
  </p>

  <h2 id="changes">9. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy when the website, the services we use or the law change. The date of the last update
    is shown at the top of this page.
  </p>
</LegalPage>
